<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Device raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Device raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its recommendation on Integrated Device Technology Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3/4 to 11-7/8 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
